#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:8
msgid ":index:`Basic Variables <variables; basic>`"
msgstr ":index:`基本变量 <variables; basic>`"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:10
msgid "These variables are populated from MusicBrainz data for most releases, without any special Picard settings."
msgstr "这些变量从 MusicBrainz 数据中为大多数发行品自动填充，无需任何 Picard 设置。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:12
msgid "Some variables provide the :index:`MusicBrainz Identifier (MBID) <identifier; musicbrainz, mbid>` of the entity. The MBID is a 32-character identifier assigned to an entity (e.g.: artist, album, track or work) to uniquely identify the entity. For more information about MBIDs, please see the `MusicBrainz Identifier <https://musicbrainz.org/doc/MusicBrainz_Identifier>`_ page in the MusicBrainz documentation."
msgstr ""
"一些变量提供实体的 :index:`MusicBrainz 标识符 (MBID) <identifier; "
"musicbrainz, mbid>`。MBID 是分配给实体（例如：艺术家、专辑、音轨或作品）的 "
"32 字符标识符，用于唯一标识该实体。有关 MBID 的更多信息，请参阅 MusicBrainz "
"文档中的 `MusicBrainz Identifier <https://musicbrainz.org/doc/"
"MusicBrainz_Identifier>`_ 页面。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:16
msgid "Variables will not be created if there was no value retrieved for the variable from the MusicBrainz database."
msgstr "如果从 MusicBrainz 数据库中没有检索到变量的值，则不会创建变量。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:18
msgid "**_absolutetracknumber**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:20
msgid "The absolute number of this track disregarding the disc number (i.e.: ``%_absolutetracknumber%`` of ``%_totalalbumtracks%``). For example, this value would be 11 for the second track on disc 2 where disc 1 has 9 tracks. (*since Picard 1.3*)"
msgstr ""
"忽略磁盘编号的音轨绝对编号（即：``%_absolutetracknumber%`` of "
"``%_totalalbumtracks%``）。例如，对于第二张磁盘上的第二首音轨，其中磁盘 1 有 "
"9 首音轨，此值为 11。(*自 Picard 1.3 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:22
msgid "**_albumartists**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:24
msgid "A multi-value variable containing the names of the album's artists. These could be either \"standardized\" or \"as credited\" depending on whether the \"Use standardized artist names\" metadata option is enabled. (*since Picard 1.3*)"
msgstr ""
"一个多值变量，包含专辑艺术家的名称。这些名称可以是“标准化”或“按 Credit”显示，"
"具体取决于是否启用了“使用标准化艺术家名称”元数据选项。(*自 Picard 1.3 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:28
msgid "As of Picard 3.0 this variable has been promoted to a tag, and this new tag should be used in scripting as ``%albumartists%``. The ``%_albumartists%`` variable is now obsolete and should not be used. It has been **temporarily** retained for backwards compatibility, and will be removed in a future release of Picard."
msgstr ""
"自 Picard 3.0 起，此变量已提升为标签，并在脚本中应使用 "
"``%albumartists%``。``%_albumartists%`` 变量现已过时，不应使用。它已被 **暂"
"时** 保留以向后兼容，将在 Picard 的未来版本中移除。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:30
msgid "**_albumartistcomment**"
msgstr "**_albumartistcomment**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:32
msgid "The disambiguation comment for the album artist. Only set for single-artist credits, empty for collaborations. (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr "专辑艺术家的歧义评论。仅适用于单艺术家 Credit，合作为空。(*自 Picard 3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:34
msgid "**_albumartists_comments**"
msgstr "**_albumartists_comments**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:36
msgid "Multi-value list of the disambiguation comments for all credited album artists (one per artist, in order). (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr ""
"所有 Credit 专辑艺术家的歧义评论列表（每个艺术家一个，按顺序）。(*自 Picard "
"3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:38
msgid "**_albumartists_countries**"
msgstr "**_albumartists_countries**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:40
msgid "A multi-value variable containing the country codes for all of the credited album artists, in the same order as the artists. Duplicate country codes will be shown if there are more than one artist from the same country. If a country code is not provided by the webservice the code \"XX\" will be used to indicate an unknown country. For example, if the first credited artist is from Great Britain and there are two other credited artists from Canada, the value would be \"GB; CA; CA\". (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr ""
"一个多值变量，包含所有署名专辑艺术家的国家代码，顺序与艺术家相同。如果来自同"
"一个国家的艺术家有多个，则会显示重复的国家代码。如果网络服务未提供国家代码，"
"则使用代码 \"XX\" 表示未知国家。例如，如果第一个署名艺术家来自英国，另外还有"
"两个来自加拿大的署名艺术家，则值为 \"GB; CA; CA\"。 (*自 Picard 3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:42
msgid "**_albumartists_sort**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:44
msgid "A multi-value variable containing the sort names of the album's artists. (*since Picard 1.3*)"
msgstr "一个多值变量，包含专辑艺术家的排序名称。 (*自 Picard 1.3 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:46
msgid "**_artistcomment**"
msgstr "**_artistcomment**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:48
msgid "The disambiguation comment for the track artist. Only set for single-artist credits, empty for collaborations. (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr "音轨艺术家的指代性评论。仅用于单一艺术家署名，合作为空。 (*自 Picard 3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:50
msgid "**_artists_comments**"
msgstr "**_artists_comments**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:52
msgid "Multi-value list of the disambiguation comments for all credited track artists (one per artist, in order). (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr ""
"所有署名音轨艺术家的指代性评论的多值列表（每个艺术家一个，按顺序）。 (*自 "
"Picard 3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:54
msgid "**_artists_countries**"
msgstr "**_artists_countries**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:56
msgid "A multi-value variable containing the country codes for all of the credited track artists, in the same order as the artists. Duplicate country codes will be shown if there are more than one artist from the same country. If a country code is not provided by the webservice the code \"XX\" will be used to indicate an unknown country. For example, if the first credited artist is from Great Britain and there are two other credited artists from Canada, the value would be \"GB; CA; CA\". (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr ""
"一个多值变量，包含所有署名音轨艺术家的国家代码，顺序与艺术家相同。如果来自同"
"一个国家的艺术家有多个，则会显示重复的国家代码。如果网络服务未提供国家代码，"
"则使用代码 \"XX\" 表示未知国家。例如，如果第一个署名艺术家来自英国，另外还有"
"两个来自加拿大的署名艺术家，则值为 \"GB; CA; CA\"。 (*自 Picard 3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:58
msgid "**_artists_sort**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:60
msgid "A multi-value variable containing the sort names of the track's artists. (*since Picard 1.3*)"
msgstr "一个多值变量，包含音轨艺术家的排序名称。 (*自 Picard 1.3 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:62
msgid "**_datatrack**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:64
msgid "Set to 1 if the track is a \"`data track <https://wiki.musicbrainz.org/Style/Unknown_and_untitled/Special_purpose_track_title#Data_tracks>`_\", otherwise empty. (*since Picard 1.3.1*)"
msgstr ""
"如果音轨是 \"`data track <https://wiki.musicbrainz.org/Style/"
"Unknown_and_untitled/Special_purpose_track_title#Data_tracks>`_，则设置为 1，"
"否则为空。 (*自 Picard 1.3.1 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:66
msgid "**_discpregap**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:68
msgid "Set to 1 if the disc the track is on has a \"`pregap track <https://musicbrainz.org/doc/Terminology#hidden_track>`_\", otherwise empty. (*since Picard 1.4*)"
msgstr ""
"如果音轨所在的磁盘有 \"`pregap track <https://musicbrainz.org/doc/"
"Terminology#hidden_track>`_，则设置为 1，否则为空。 (*自 Picard 1.4 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:70
msgid "**_folksonomy_tags**"
msgstr "**_folksonomy_tags**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:72
msgid "Unfiltered list of all non-genre folksonomy tags loaded from MusicBrainz. Requires the :doc:`Use genres from MusicBrainz <../config/options_genres>` option to be enabled. (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr ""
"从 MusicBrainz 加载的所有非流派 folksonomy 标签的未过滤列表。需要启用 "
":doc:`Use genres from MusicBrainz <../config/options_genres>` 选项。 (*自 "
"Picard 3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:74
msgid "**_genres**"
msgstr "**_genres**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:76
msgid "Unfiltered list of all genres loaded from MusicBrainz. Requires the :doc:`Use genres from MusicBrainz <../config/options_genres>` option to be enabled.  (*since Picard 3.0*)"
msgstr ""
"从 MusicBrainz 加载的所有流派的无过滤列表。需要启用 :doc:`Use genres from "
"MusicBrainz <../config/options_genres>` 选项。 (*自 Picard 3.0 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:78
msgid "**_multiartist**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:80
msgid "Set to 1 if not all of the tracks on the album have the same primary artist, otherwise empty. (*since Picard 1.3*)"
msgstr ""
"如果专辑上的所有音轨不具有相同的 PRIMARY ARTIST，则设置为 1，否则为空。 (*自 "
"Picard 1.3 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:82
msgid "**_musicbrainz_discids**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:84
msgid "A multi-value variable containing a list of all of the disc ids attached to the selected release. The list provided for each medium only includes the disc ids attached to that medium. For example, the list provided for Disc 1 of a three CD set will not include the disc ids attached to discs 2 and 3 of the set."
msgstr ""
"包含所有附加到选定发行品的 disc id 列表的多值变量。为每个媒介提供的列表仅包括"
"附加到该媒介的 disc id。例如，为三张 CD 集合的 Disc 1 提供的列表不包括集合中 "
"Disc 2 和 Disc 3 的 disc id。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:86
msgid "**_musicbrainz_tracknumber**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:88
msgid "The track number written as on the MusicBrainz release, such as vinyl numbering (A1, A2…)."
msgstr "作为 MusicBrainz 发行品上写入的音轨编号，例如黑胶编号 (A1, A2…)。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:90
msgid "**_pregap**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:92
msgid "Set to 1 if the track is a \"`pregap track <https://musicbrainz.org/doc/Terminology#hidden_track>`_\", otherwise empty. (*since Picard 1.3.1*)"
msgstr ""
"如果音轨是 \"`pregap track <https://musicbrainz.org/doc/"
"Terminology#hidden_track>`_\"，则设置为 1，否则为空。 (*自 Picard 1.3.1 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:96
msgid "**_primaryreleasetype**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:98
msgid "The primary type of the release group (i.e.: *album*, *single*, *ep*, *broadcast*, or *other*)."
msgstr "发行组的主要类型（即：*专辑*、*single*、*ep*、*broadcast* 或 *other*）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:100
msgid "**_rating**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:102
msgid "The rating of the track from 0-5 by MusicBrainz users."
msgstr "由 MusicBrainz 用户评分为 0-5 的音轨评分。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:104
msgid "**_recordingcomment**"
msgstr "**_recordingcomment**"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:106
msgid "The disambiguation comment for the recording associated with a track. (*since Picard 0.15*)"
msgstr "与音轨关联的录音的歧义评论。 (*自 Picard 0.15 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:108
msgid "**_recording_firstreleasedate**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:110
msgid "The date of the earliest recording for a track in the format YYYY-MM-DD. (*Since Picard 2.6*)"
msgstr "音轨最早录音的日期，格式为 YYYY-MM-DD。 (*自 Picard 2.6 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:112
msgid "**_releaseannotation**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:114
msgid "The annotation comment for the release. (*since Picard 2.6*)"
msgstr "发行品的注释评论。(*自 Picard 2.6 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:116
msgid "**_releasecomment**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:118
msgid "The disambiguation comment for the release. (*since Picard 0.15*)"
msgstr "发行品的区分评论。(*自 Picard 0.15 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:120
msgid "**_releasecountries**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:122
msgid "A multi-value variable containing the complete list of release countries for the release. (*since Picard 2.3.1*)"
msgstr "包含发行品所有发行国家的多值变量。(*自 Picard 2.3.1 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:124
msgid "**_releasegroup**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:126
msgid "The title of the release group. This is typically the same as the album title, but can be different."
msgstr "发行组的标题。这通常是专辑标题，但可能不同。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:128
msgid "**_releasegroup_firstreleasedate**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:130
msgid "The date of the earliest release in the release group in the format YYYY-MM-DD. This is intended to provide, for example, the release date of the vinyl version of what you have on CD. (*Since Picard 2.6*)"
msgstr ""
"发行组中最早发行日期，格式为 YYYY-MM-DD。这旨在提供，例如，你拥有的 CD 上的黑"
"胶版本发行日期。(*自 Picard 2.6 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:134
msgid "This is the same information provided by default in the ``originaldate`` tag."
msgstr "这是 ``originaldate`` 标签默认提供的信息。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:136
msgid "**_releasegroupcomment**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:138
msgid "The disambiguation comment for the release group."
msgstr "发行组的区分评论。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:140
msgid "**_releaselanguage**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:142
msgid "The language of the release as per `ISO 639-3 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639-3>`_. (*since Picard 0.10*)"
msgstr ""
"根据 `ISO 639-3 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639-3>`_ 的发行语言。(*自 "
"Picard 0.10 起*)"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:146
msgid "**_secondaryreleasetype**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:148
msgid "Zero or more secondary types (i.e.: *audiobook*, *compilation*, *dj-mix*, *interview*, *live*, *mixtape/street*, *remix*, *soundtrack*, or *spokenword*) for the release group."
msgstr ""
"发行组的零个或多个次要类型（即：*audiobook*、*合辑*、*dj-"
"mix*、*interview*、*live*、*mixtape/street*、*remix*、*soundtrack* 或 "
"*spokenword*）。"

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:150
msgid "**_totalalbumtracks**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../variables/variables_basic.rst:152
msgid "The total number of tracks across all discs of this release."
msgstr "此发行品所有光盘中的音轨总数。"
